<view class="actions-page">
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state">正在读取处理清单…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error"><text>{{error}}</text><button bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{booking && !loading}}">
    <view class="summary"><view class="summary-head"><text>{{booking.vehicle.plateNumber}}</text><text class="badge">{{canAct ? '预检待处理' : '已提交处理'}}</text></view><text class="title">{{stateTitle}}</text><text class="subtitle">{{booking.station.name}}</text><view class="money"><text>{{moneyLabel}}</text><text>¥{{amount}}</text></view><text class="muted">{{stateNote}}</text></view>
    <view class="section-title"><text>检测站发现的问题</text><text>资料预检，非正式检验结论</text></view>
    <view class="card issues"><view wx:for="{{issues}}" wx:key="code" class="issue"><image src="/assets/icons/warning-circle.png"/><view><text class="issue-title">{{item.label}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.action === 'wash' ? '附近洗车 · 不竞价' : item.action === 'repair' ? '维修 · 多店报价' : '补充或核对资料'}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.effect}}</text></view></view><view class="station-note"><text>检测站说明</text><text>{{booking.precheck.reasonText}}</text></view></view>
    <block wx:if="{{canAct}}">
      <view wx:if="{{hasWash}}" class="card service-card"><image src="/assets/icons/drop.png"/><view><text class="issue-title">先清洁，再核对</text><text class="muted">选择附近适合这辆车的洗车店与套餐，也可以自行清洁。</text></view><button bindtap="openWash">附近洗车店</button></view>
      <view wx:if="{{hasRepair}}" class="card repair-card"><view class="card-heading"><image src="/assets/icons/wrench.png"/><text>车损与故障灯维修</text></view><text class="muted">选择需要维修的问题，多家门店报价，由你决定。需到店检测后确认的项目和费用，由门店在报价中说明。</text><view class="repair-selection"><button wx:for="{{issues}}" wx:key="code" wx:if="{{item.action === 'repair'}}" class="{{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-code="{{item.code}}" bindtap="toggleRepairIssue">{{item.label}} · {{item.selected ? '已选' : '未选'}}</button></view><text class="field-label">本次将共享的原始问题照片</text><scroll-view scroll-x class="share-photos"><image wx:for="{{repairPhotos}}" wx:key="kind" src="{{item.url}}" mode="aspectFill" data-url="{{item.url}}" bindtap="preview"/></scroll-view><checkbox-group bindchange="consentChanged"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="share" checked="{{consented}}" color="#1768cf"/><text>同意向维修报价门店共享所选问题、相关车辆照片及必要车型信息。行驶证不共享。</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="primary" bindtap="openRepair" disabled="{{busy}}">发起 / 查看维修报价</button></view>
    </block>
    <view wx:if="{{services.length}}" class="card"><text class="card-title">关联服务</text><button wx:for="{{services}}" wx:key="id" class="service-link" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-type="{{item.type}}" bindtap="openService"><view><text>{{item.label}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.statusText}}</text></view><image src="/assets/icons/caret-right.png"/></button><text class="muted">服务完成后仍需提交处理照片，由检测站复核。</text></view>
    <block wx:if="{{canAct}}">
      <view class="section-title"><text>处理后，重新提交</text><text>平台服务 / 自行处理均可</text></view>
      <view class="card"><text class="card-title">补充处理后的照片</text><text class="muted">标注“需更新 / 请补拍”的位置必须补拍；其他位置可以保留。原照片继续留档。</text><view class="photo-grid"><view wx:for="{{photos}}" wx:key="kind" class="photo {{item.needsUpdate && !item.updated ? 'needs-update' : ''}} {{item.updated ? 'updated-ok' : ''}}"><image wx:if="{{item.url}}" src="{{item.url}}" mode="aspectFill" data-url="{{item.url}}" bindtap="preview"/><view wx:else class="photo-empty"><image src="/assets/icons/camera.png"/></view><view wx:if="{{item.needsUpdate && !item.updated}}" class="photo-ribbon">请补拍</view><text>{{item.label}}</text><text class="photo-state {{item.updated ? 'ready' : item.needsUpdate ? 'needs' : 'keep'}}">{{item.updated ? '已更新' : item.needsUpdate ? '需更新' : '可保留'}}</text><button data-kind="{{item.kind}}" bindtap="upload" loading="{{uploadingKind === item.kind}}" disabled="{{busy || uploadingKind}}">{{item.updated ? '重新上传' : item.needsUpdate ? '立即补拍' : '补拍 / 上传'}}</button></view></view><text class="field-label">处理说明</text><textarea maxlength="500" value="{{resolutionNote}}" bindinput="noteInput" placeholder="例如：已清洗车身并补拍；故障灯已由门店检查处理，附更新后的仪表盘照片。"/><text class="field-label">重新选择本站预约时段</text><picker range="{{slotLabels}}" value="{{slotIndex}}" bindchange="slotChanged" disabled="{{!slots.length || busy}}"><view class="slot-picker"><text>{{slotIndex >= 0 ? slotLabels[slotIndex] : slots.length ? '请选择时段' : '本站暂无可约时段，可稍后重试或申请退款'}}</text><image src="/assets/icons/caret-right.png"/></view></picker><text class="muted">同一车辆、站点和取送地址，保留本单已付价格；变更计价信息请退款后重新预约。</text></view>
      <view class="footer"><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || uploadingKind || !slots.length}}">提交检测站复核</button><button class="refund" bindtap="refund" disabled="{{busy || uploadingKind}}">不继续办理，申请退款</button><text class="muted">申请退款将取消年检订单并原路退回已支付金额；单独下单的洗车、维修不受影响。</text></view>
    </block>
    <button wx:else class="primary" bindtap="backToOrder">查看年检订单进度</button>
  </block>
</view>
